Performance (CPU/memory) improvements for cell noise tools.

Factor out duplicate code between ReadNoiseFromFileTool and
NoiseCaloCellsFromFileBaseTool (and derived classes) into a new base class
ReadNoiseFromFileBaseTool.

Precompute and cache the cell ID -> bin calculation rather then possibly
having to look at cell positions each time.  Avoid unneeded per-cell
virtual function calls.

Restructure so that the noise data are CaloCellConstantsSvc.  Use unique_ptr
to avoid explicit deletions.
